\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Quality--predictability plane over the 70 instances. Faint markers are individual evolved rules: amber with the interval-width terminals, grey without them; open markers for the makespan objective, filled for the robust one at any $\lambda $. Solid curves join the mean of each arm at each $\lambda $ of the robust-fitness sweep, Eq.~\eqref  {eq:robustfit}. With the width terminals, increasing $\lambda $ trades expected makespan for narrower intervals; without them the five means, $\lambda = 0$ to $4$, fall within $0.13$ points of width and are left unlabeled.}}{41}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:lambda}{{8}{41}{Quality--predictability plane over the 70 instances. Faint markers are individual evolved rules: amber with the interval-width terminals, grey without them; open markers for the makespan objective, filled for the robust one at any $\lambda $. Solid curves join the mean of each arm at each $\lambda $ of the robust-fitness sweep, Eq.~\eqref {eq:robustfit}. With the width terminals, increasing $\lambda $ trades expected makespan for narrower intervals; without them the five means, $\lambda = 0$ to $4$, fall within $0.13$ points of width and are left unlabeled}{figure.8}{}}
